  },
  {
   "id": "page-mbc-home-b01",
   "page_id": "page-mbc-home",
   "parent_block_id": null,
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "Settlement notes for closed disputes, owner relationship notes and the desk's onboarding list.",
   "order": 1,
   "created_time": "2026-01-05T09:00:00.000Z",
   "last_edited_time": "2026-01-05T09:00:00.000Z",
   "has_children": false,
   "checked": null
  },
  {
   "id": "page-mbc-set-2102-b00",
   "page_id": "page-mbc-set-2102",
   "parent_block_id": null,
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "Owners counted the shift from Riga anchorage B to berth 3 (2h 40m). Clause 18 excludes anchor aweigh to all fast. Owners accepted on 4 September 2026 after the Fairlead call.",
   "order": 0,
   "created_time": "2026-09-04T09:00:00.000Z",
   "last_edited_time": "2026-09-04T09:00:00.000Z",
   "has_children": false,
   "checked": null
  },
  {
   "id": "page-mbc-set-2102-b01",
   "page_id": "page-mbc-set-2102",
   "parent_block_id": null,
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "Settled at Merrow's figure USD 6,875.00.",
   "order": 1,
   "created_time": "2026-09-04T09:00:00.000Z",
   "last_edited_time": "2026-09-04T09:00:00.000Z",
   "has_children": false,
   "checked": null
  },
  {
   "id": "page-mbc-set-2105-b00",
   "page_id": "page-mbc-set-2105",
   "parent_block_id": null,
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "Owners ran laytime from NOR. Kestrel charter clause 15 gives 12 running hours' turn time. Owners withdrew.",
   "order": 0,
   "created_time": "2026-09-10T09:00:00.000Z",
   "last_edited_time": "2026-09-10T09:00:00.000Z",
   "has_children": false,
   "checked": null
  },
  {
   "id": "page-mbc-set-2105-b01",
   "page_id": "page-mbc-set-2105",
   "parent_block_id": null,
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "Settled at Merrow's figure EUR 4,500.00.",
   "order": 1,
   "created_time": "2026-09-10T09:00:00.000Z",
   "last_edited_time": "2026-09-10T09:00:00.000Z",
   "has_children": false,
   "checked": null
  },
  {
   "id": "page-mbc-set-2108-b00",
   "page_id": "page-mbc-set-2108",
   "parent_block_id": null,
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "Owners stopped the clock at sailing; clause 19 ends laytime at completion of loading. Despatch at Merrow's figure USD 5,500.00.",
   "order": 0,
   "created_time": "2026-09-18T09:00:00.000Z",
   "last_edited_time": "2026-09-18T09:00:00.000Z",
   "has_children": false,
   "checked": null
  },
  {
   "id": "page-mbc-owners-b00",
   "page_id": "page-mbc-owners",
   "parent_block_id": null,
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "Aldwick: prompt payers, dislike surprises; call before anything in writing.",
   "order": 0,
   "created_time": "2026-06-15T09:00:00.000Z",
   "last_edited_time": "2026-06-15T09:00:00.000Z",
   "has_children": false,
   "checked": null
  },
  {
   "id": "page-mbc-owners-b01",
   "page_id": "page-mbc-owners",
   "parent_block_id": null,
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "Holmfirth: always start from the owners' own sheet; expect SHEX arguments.",
   "order": 1,
   "created_time": "2026-06-15T09:00:00.000Z",
   "last_edited_time": "2026-06-15T09:00:00.000Z",
   "has_children": false,
   "checked": null
  },
  {
   "id": "page-mbc-owners-b02",
   "page_id": "page-mbc-owners",
   "parent_block_id": null,
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "Kestrel: EUR charter; Femke Aalders handles claims; reads every SOF line.",
   "order": 2,
   "created_time": "2026-06-15T09:00:00.000Z",
   "last_edited_time": "2026-06-15T09:00:00.000Z",
   "has_children": false,
   "checked": null
  },
  {
   "id": "page-mbc-owners-b03",
   "page_id": "page-mbc-owners",
   "parent_block_id": null,
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "Tarnby: will claim from NOR whenever the vessel berths on arrival.",
   "order": 3,
   "created_time": "2026-06-15T09:00:00.000Z",
   "last_edited_time": "2026-06-15T09:00:00.000Z",
   "has_children": false,
   "checked": null
  },
  {
   "id": "page-mbc-onboard-b00",
   "page_id": "page-mbc-onboard",
   "parent_block_id": null,
   "type": "to_do",
   "text": "Read the four 2026 charter parties (clauses 14-24).",
   "order": 0,
   "created_time": "2026-02-01T09:00:00.000Z",
   "last_edited_time": "2026-02-01T09:00:00.000Z",
   "has_children": false,
   "checked": null
  },
  {
   "id": "page-mbc-onboard-b01",
   "page_id": "page-mbc-onboard",
   "parent_block_id": null,
   "type": "to_do",
   "text": "Read the desk method page in Confluence.",
   "order": 1,
   "created_time": "2026-02-01T09:00:00.000Z",
   "last_edited_time": "2026-02-01T09:00:00.000Z",
   "has_children": false,
   "checked": null
  },
  {
   "id": "page-mbc-onboard-b02",
   "page_id": "page-mbc-onboard",
   "parent_block_id": null,
   "type": "to_do",
   "text": "Walk through one Q2 statement of facts with Ines.",
   "order": 2,
   "created_time": "2026-02-01T09:00:00.000Z",
   "last_edited_time": "2026-02-01T09:00:00.000Z",
   "has_children": false,
   "checked": null
  },
  {
   "id": "page-mbc-onboard-b03",
   "page_id": "page-mbc-onboard",
   "parent_block_id": null,
   "type": "to_do",
   "text": "Never e-mail owners or brokers from the claims mailbox.",
   "order": 3,
   "created_time": "2026-02-01T09:00:00.000Z",
   "last_edited_time": "2026-02-01T09:00:00.000Z",
   "has_children": false,
   "checked": null
  },
  {
   "id": "page-mbc-opslog-q3-b00",
   "page_id": "page-mbc-opslog-q3",
   "parent_block_id": null,
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "Operations (Sefa Ndlovu) forwards the terminals' control-room entries for stoppages at berths where a Merrow vessel was working. Kept here for reference; the agents' statements of facts remain the record of times.",
   "order": 0,
   "created_time": "2026-10-06T09:00:00.000Z",
   "last_edited_time": "2026-10-06T09:00:00.000Z",
   "has_children": false,
   "checked": null
  },
  {
   "id": "page-mbc-opslog-q3-b01",
   "page_id": "page-mbc-opslog-q3",
   "parent_block_id": null,
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "Ventspils VCT berth 21, 5 Jul 03:10-06:25 (MV Aldwick Star): control room stood SL-B down when the mean wind at the loader passed its 20 m/s operating limit; restarted once it held below 15 m/s.",
   "order": 1,
   "created_time": "2026-10-06T09:00:00.000Z",
   "last_edited_time": "2026-10-06T09:00:00.000Z",
   "has_children": false,
   "checked": null
  },
  {
   "id": "page-mbc-opslog-q3-b02",
   "page_id": "page-mbc-opslog-q3",
   "parent_block_id": null,
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "Gdansk Port Polnocny coal quay 2, 15 Jul 10:15-14:20 (MV Aldwick Rose): conveyor CV-2 tripped on overload; belt restored 14:20.",
   "order": 2,
   "created_time": "2026-10-06T09:00:00.000Z",
   "last_edited_time": "2026-10-06T09:00:00.000Z",
   "has_children": false,
   "checked": null
  },
  {
   "id": "page-mbc-opslog-q3-b03",
   "page_id": "page-mbc-opslog-q3",
   "parent_block_id": null,
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "Riga Coal Terminal berth 3, 22 Jul 20:20-23:40 (MV Aldwick Star): SL-3 stood down by the control room, wind over the loader's operating limit (gusts to 26 m/s at the mast); back in service when it eased.",
   "order": 3,
   "created_time": "2026-10-06T09:00:00.000Z",
   "last_edited_time": "2026-10-06T09:00:00.000Z",
   "has_children": false,
   "checked": null
  },
  {
   "id": "page-mbc-opslog-q3-b04",
   "page_id": "page-mbc-opslog-q3",
   "parent_block_id": null,
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "Senalia silo quay 1, Rouen, 5 Aug 03:00-04:10 (MV Holmfirth Grace): spout S-2 stood down for a planned gallery belt change.",
   "order": 4,
   "created_time": "2026-10-06T09:00:00.000Z",
   "last_edited_time": "2026-10-06T09:00:00.000Z",
   "has_children": false,
   "checked": null
  },
  {
   "id": "page-mbc-opslog-q3-b05",
   "page_id": "page-mbc-opslog-q3",
   "parent_block_id": null,
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "LKAB Fagernes ore pier 5, Narvik, 25 Aug 04:00-13:20 (MV Tarnby Ore): SL-1 hydraulic repair before the vessel could start loading.",
   "order": 5,
   "created_time": "2026-10-06T09:00:00.000Z",
   "last_edited_time": "2026-10-06T09:00:00.000Z",
   "has_children": false,
   "checked": null
  },
  {
   "id": "page-mbc-opslog-q3-b06",
   "page_id": "page-mbc-opslog-q3",
   "parent_block_id": null,
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "Malmhamnen ore berth 2, Lulea, 11 Sep 02:15-07:40 (MV Tarnby Fjord): SL-2 boom fault; repaired 07:40.",
   "order": 6,
   "created_time": "2026-10-06T09:00:00.000Z",
   "last_edited_time": "2026-10-06T09:00:00.000Z",
   "has_children": false,
   "checked": null
  },
  {
   "id": "page-mbc-opslog-q3-b07",
   "page_id": "page-mbc-opslog-q3",
   "parent_block_id": null,
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "Botlek bulk berth 7, Rotterdam, 22 Sep 03:00-05:40 (MV Kestrel Tern): MHC-2 and MHC-3 laid up by the terminal with the wind above the cranes' operating limit; released when it dropped.",
   "order": 7,
   "created_time": "2026-10-06T09:00:00.000Z",
   "last_edited_time": "2026-10-06T09:00:00.000Z",
   "has_children": false,
   "checked": null
  },
  {
   "id": "page-mbc-opslog-q3-b08",
   "page_id": "page-mbc-opslog-q3",
   "parent_block_id": null,
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "Malmhamnen ore berth 1, Lulea, 22 Sep 15:40-19:00 (MV Tarnby Ore): SL-1 stood down by the control room, wind above the loader limit (gusts 27 m/s at the mast); back in service 19:00.",
   "order": 8,
   "created_time": "2026-10-06T09:00:00.000Z",
   "last_edited_time": "2026-10-06T09:00:00.000Z",
   "has_children": false,
   "checked": null
  }
 ],
